# Repo-level ignores for compose builds (api + front)

### OS / editors
.DS_Store
.idea
*.swp
*~

### Git metadata (keep sources; drop history from build context)
.git
**/.git
.gitmodules
.gitlab
.gitlab-ci.yml
.gitpod
.gitpod.yml

### Docs & unrelated
docs
changes
templates
scripts
CODEOWNERS
CONTRIBUTING.md
CHANGELOG.md
DEPLOY.md
LICENSE

### Python junk
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.tox
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.sqlite3
api/tests

### Local env & data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
**/data
typesense

### Tayra / Flutter build artefacts (rebuilt in image)
tayra/build
tayra/.dart_tool
tayra/.flutter-plugins
tayra/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
tayra/android/.gradle
tayra/android/**/build
tayra/ios
tayra/macos/Flutter/ephemeral
tayra/linux/flutter/ephemeral
tayra/windows/flutter/ephemeral
tayra/build-dir
tayra/flatpak
tayra/test
tayra/**/*.iml

### Front leftovers
front/dist
front/node_modules
